  "id": "hyperarousal",
  "term": "hyperarousal",
  "definition": "Hyperarousal is a state of unusually heightened alertness and physiological activation. In the packet, it is described through signs such as tension and anxiety along with increased sympathetic activity, faster brain activity, and higher metabolic, hormonal, temperature, and heart-rate measures, and it is linked especially to insomnia and chronic stress.",
